    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: "<SFX_santi_concerned> Sure\u2026 I was going to ask you if this is
        safe. I couldn\u2019t even pull the cork out. It\u2019s stuck on the rim
        of the bottle."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: "I think it\u2019s the cause of the ringing. I tried to take it out,
        but-<cut>"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
