    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'I am merely considering the options I have to distract the guards.
        It would need to be something they deem important enough to leave their posts
        for, after all.

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: "But unfortunately, this padlock is barring my entrance\u2026 For now.
        I will try to think of a way to get through."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 9032494519262131888, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
